400
00:27:40.410 --> 00:27:43.920
Ja sinilill on sinine.

401
00:27:45.240 --> 00:27:48.330
Ning ülane on valge.

402
00:27:49.770 --> 00:27:53.430
Ja pardipoeg on kullane

403
00:27:54.330 --> 00:27:56.940
