446
00:30:17.010 --> 00:30:17.850
Arno Tali nagu.

447
00:30:17.950 --> 00:30:20.050
Jaa.

448
00:30:20.800 --> 00:30:21.960
Tähendab,
see oleks liiga lihtsalt öeldud,

449
00:30:22.060 --> 00:30:26.470
